# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day20

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| enhance | 향상시키다 | Exercise can enhance physical health. |
| inhibit | 억제하다 | Lack of sunlight may inhibit plant growth. |
| facilitate | 촉진하다, 용이하게 하다 | Technology can facilitate communication. |

---

## Synonyms

### enhance
→ improve / strengthen

### inhibit
→ prevent / restrict

### facilitate
→ assist / make easier

---

## Useful Collocations

enhance performance
→ 성과를 향상시키다

inhibit growth
→ 성장을 억제하다

facilitate communication
→ 의사소통을 용이하게 하다

